      "values:originalText": "There is to be a Chief Executive Officer of the Centre.\nNote:\nPart V deals with the appointment and terms and conditions of the\nCEO.",
      "skos:definition": "There is to be a Chief Executive Officer of the Centre.\nNote:\nPart V deals with the appointment and terms and conditions of the\nCEO.",
