    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Functions of the CEO",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The functions of the CEO are:\n(a) to formulate programs and policies with respect to\nagricultural research for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n(i) identifying agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(ii) finding solutions to agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(b) to commission agricultural research by persons or institutions\n(whether the research is to be conducted in Australia or\noverseas) in accordance with such programs and policies; and\n(c) to communicate to persons and institutions the results of such\nagricultural research; and",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The functions of the CEO are:\n(a) to formulate programs and policies with respect to\nagricultural research for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n(i) identifying agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(ii) finding solutions to agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(b) to commission agricultural research by persons or institutions\n(whether the research is to be conducted in Australia or\noverseas) in accordance with such programs and policies; and\n(c) to communicate to persons and institutions the results of such\nagricultural research; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "216d8d03879e259bbb60bae9f00caca2cc43cc0df04feb9eff3655c6ba6ff9dc",
      "skos:note": "The CEO must formulate programs and policies for agricultural research."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Functions of the CEO",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The functions of the CEO are:\n(a) to formulate programs and policies with respect to\nagricultural research for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n(i) identifying agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(ii) finding solutions to agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(b) to commission agricultural research by persons or institutions\n(whether the research is to be conducted in Australia or\noverseas) in accordance with such programs and policies; and\n(c) to communicate to persons and institutions the results of such\nagricultural research; and"
    },
