    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-5a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5A Power of Minister to give directions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-5a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, give directions to the CEO with\nrespect to the performance of the CEO’s functions under this Act\n(including in relation to the appropriate strategic direction the CEO\nshould take in performing his or her functions).\nNote:\nA direction under this section is included in the annual report: see\nsection 39.\n(2) A direction given under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, give directions to the CEO with\nrespect to the performance of the CEO’s functions under this Act\n(including in relation to the appropriate strategic direction the CEO\nshould take in performing his or her functions).\nNote:\nA direction under this section is included in the annual report: see\nsection 39.\n(2) A direction given under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
