      "values:originalText": "The functions of the staff of the Centre referred to in section 30 are\nto assist the CEO perform his or her functions.\n\n\nCommission for International Agricultural Research  Part III\nThe Commission  Division 1\nSection 7\nAustralian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982\nCompilation date: 27/03/2026"
    },
