    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-16a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16A Termination of appointment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-16a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Governor-General may terminate the appointment of a\nCommissioner for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity.\n(2) The Governor-General must terminate the appointment of a\nCommissioner if:\n(a) the Commissioner:\n(i) becomes bankrupt; or\n(ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of\nbankrupt or insolvent debtors; or\n(iii) compounds with his or her creditors; or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Governor-General may terminate the appointment of a\nCommissioner for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity.\n(2) The Governor-General must terminate the appointment of a\nCommissioner if:\n(a) the Commissioner:\n(i) becomes bankrupt; or\n(ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of\nbankrupt or insolvent debtors; or\n(iii) compounds with his or her creditors; or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-16a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-16a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "450a12a2c03e362267d559c4851a77515eccfc79b7b8118f7f49ce89145e94a4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-16a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16A Termination of appointment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Governor-General may terminate the appointment of a\nCommissioner for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity.\n(2) The Governor-General must terminate the appointment of a\nCommissioner if:\n(a) the Commissioner:\n(i) becomes bankrupt; or\n(ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of\nbankrupt or insolvent debtors; or\n(iii) compounds with his or her creditors; or"
    },
