    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-18",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18 Function of Council",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-18"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The function of the Council is to provide advice to the Minister\nregarding:\n(a) agricultural problems of developing countries; and\n(b) programs and policies with respect to agricultural research\nfor either or both of the following purposes:\n(i) identifying agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(ii) finding solutions to agricultural problems of developing\ncountries.\n(2) The Council shall provide advice under subsection (1) on such\noccasions as it thinks fit and on request by the Minister.\n(3) The Minister shall arrange for a copy of any advice provided by the\nCouncil to be furnished to the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The function of the Council is to provide advice to the Minister\nregarding:\n(a) agricultural problems of developing countries; and\n(b) programs and policies with respect to agricultural research\nfor either or both of the following purposes:\n(i) identifying agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(ii) finding solutions to agricultural problems of developing\ncountries.\n(2) The Council shall provide advice under subsection (1) on such\noccasions as it thinks fit and on request by the Minister.\n(3) The Minister shall arrange for a copy of any advice provided by the\nCouncil to be furnished to the Commission.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-18-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-18-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-18-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "096e44ea0dbd8c9c461652fd766a62a5e2dc8130d7b22790166900ca759d1f62"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-18",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18 Function of Council",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The function of the Council is to provide advice to the Minister\nregarding:\n(a) agricultural problems of developing countries; and\n(b) programs and policies with respect to agricultural research\nfor either or both of the following purposes:\n(i) identifying agricultural problems of developing\ncountries;\n(ii) finding solutions to agricultural problems of developing\ncountries.\n(2) The Council shall provide advice under subsection (1) on such\noccasions as it thinks fit and on request by the Minister.\n(3) The Minister shall arrange for a copy of any advice provided by the\nCouncil to be furnished to the Commission."
    },
