    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19 Constitution of Council",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-19"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Council shall consist of:\n(a) a President;\n(c) the person for the time being occupying, or performing the\nduties of, the position in the Australian Public Service known\nas Director-General, Australian International Development\nAssistance Bureau, or a person nominated by the\nDirector-General; and\n(d) not fewer than 9 nor more than 11 other members.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Council shall consist of:\n(a) a President;\n(c) the person for the time being occupying, or performing the\nduties of, the position in the Australian Public Service known\nas Director-General, Australian International Development\nAssistance Bureau, or a person nominated by the\nDirector-General; and\n(d) not fewer than 9 nor more than 11 other members.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f1ccfd0846fb400302d7007f739f38507ce39853d5c390babdc0c2b74cdc7574",
      "skos:note": "The Council must consist of a President, Director-General, and at least 9 other members."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-19",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19 Constitution of Council",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Council shall consist of:\n(a) a President;\n(c) the person for the time being occupying, or performing the\nduties of, the position in the Australian Public Service known\nas Director-General, Australian International Development\nAssistance Bureau, or a person nominated by the\nDirector-General; and\n(d) not fewer than 9 nor more than 11 other members."
    },
    {
