    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-19a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19A Remuneration and allowances",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\n\n\nThe Policy Advisory Council  Part IV\n\nSection 20\nAustralian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982\nCompilation date: 27/03/2026\noperation, the appointed member of the Council is to be paid the\nremuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n(2) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the allowances\nthat are prescribed by the regulations.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973."
    },
