      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "The President shall ensure that the Council is kept adequately\ninformed with respect to the affairs of the Centre.",
      "skos:definition": "The President shall ensure that the Council is kept adequately\ninformed with respect to the affairs of the Centre.",
