      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "An appointed member of the Council may resign his or her office\nby writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "An appointed member of the Council may resign his or her office\nby writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Minister.",
