    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-29e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29E CEO not subject to direction by the Commission on certain",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-29e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "matters\nTo avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the\nCommission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or\nexercise of powers, under:\n(a) the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act\n2013; or\n(b) the Public Service Act 1999;\nin relation to the Centre.\n\n\nStaff and consultants  Part VI\n\nSection 30\nAustralian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982\nCompilation date: 27/03/2026",
      "skos:definition": "matters\nTo avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the\nCommission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or\nexercise of powers, under:\n(a) the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act\n2013; or\n(b) the Public Service Act 1999;\nin relation to the Centre.\n\n\nStaff and consultants  Part VI\n\nSection 30\nAustralian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982\nCompilation date: 27/03/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-29e-norm"
        },
