          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-29e-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7b7ea897e462c03bdcbcc9e918d26234c3574b6f5b37774c4bc83827643c4d5f",
      "skos:note": "The CEO is not subject to direction by the Commission in relation to certain matters."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-29e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29E CEO not subject to direction by the Commission on certain",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "matters\nTo avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the\nCommission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or\nexercise of powers, under:\n(a) the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act\n2013; or\n(b) the Public Service Act 1999;\nin relation to the Centre.\n\n\nStaff and consultants  Part VI\n\nSection 30\nAustralian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982\nCompilation date: 27/03/2026"
    },
