      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "The CEO may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, engage\nconsultants to perform services for the CEO related to the CEO’s\nfunctions.",
