      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "Account\n(1) There is continued in existence the Australian Centre for\nInternational Agricultural Research Account.\nNote:\nThe Account was established by subsection 5(3) of the Financial\nManagement Legislation Amendment Act 1999.\n(2) The Account is a special account for the purposes of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013.",
      "skos:definition": "Account\n(1) There is continued in existence the Australian Centre for\nInternational Agricultural Research Account.\nNote:\nThe Account was established by subsection 5(3) of the Financial\nManagement Legislation Amendment Act 1999.\n(2) The Account is a special account for the purposes of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
