      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982#sec-26-2-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26(7) Mar",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 39,
      "values:originalText": "(7) The remaining provisions of this Act shall come into operation on the\ntwenty-eighth day after the day on which this Act receives the Royal\nAssent.\n(e)\nThe Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 was\namended by section 3 only of the Statute Law (Miscellaneous Provisions) Act\n1987, subsection 2(1) of which provides as follows:"
    },
    {
